Name: keiro-upgrade
Version: 0.11.0
Description: Upgrade guidance for projects consuming Keiro, the event-sourcing framework and durable workflow engine. One edge per released version window that needs judgement work, with upstream cohort edges entailed so a project that has never heard of Kiroku still crosses them exactly once.


